WEBVTT

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:06.940
The day is finally here...

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:13.400
The fated battle of Nonsugar and Solami Smile!

00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:15.910
We'll win and...

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:18.090
Save Jewlie!

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:20.590
I'll definitely beat her!

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:24.190
Mum, seconds!

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.080
Me too!

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:28.470
You two sure are eating up this morning.

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:31.130
Oh mum you're so silly.

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:34.170
That's a skipping rope, not pasta!

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:37.510
But you're not so bright yourself Papa.

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.390
This isn't a pizza, it's a shower cap!

00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:43.600
What a mistake!

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:47.610
Mum and Dad are more nervous than we are.

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:25.080
Valentine's Day is Not So Sweet

00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:32.760
We're live, this is "Baa until the morning".

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:36.540
I'm your host, Goat Ando, and my assistant...

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:38.170
Baa.

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:40.160
The theme of our first episode is

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:44.010
the Solami Smile vs Nonsugar epic battle, who will win?

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:45.510
Can I ask a question?

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:49.390
Look at this graph of Nonsugar's recent improvement.

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:52.990
If you overlay Solami Smile's graph on top...

00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:03.240
Interesting, so there's a chance they may surpass them in this performance.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:04.830
That's not possible!

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:09.590
Pepper-chan! If you win you can eat me!

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:14.420
Baa.

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:16.780
It's the same as my calculations.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:20.090
Nonsugar have a lot of hidden potential and are not to be underestimated.

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:21.500
Especially Chiri.

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:25.910
Flower arrangement and water tricks, such high class sense.

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:27.180
She's a foe to be reckoned with.

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:32.600
The powerful Pepper seems as if she could eat a poisonous jellyfish.

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:36.260
Yeah, we can't get careless here.

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:38.960
Getting shook are we?

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:41.540
Hey!

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:43.310
What's up, dressed like that?

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:46.580
We're heading out to the wilderness for warrior training!

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:52.740
It was quite a shock that we only just beat Garumageddon in the first round.

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:55.170
It wasn't to me though!

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:59.810
We'll watch your performance today from our rosette pacts.

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:01.630
I won't have sympathy for you if you lose!

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:04.950
Let's meet in the finals.

00:04:05.990 --> 00:04:06.860
Capisce!

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:10.220
We're off!

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:16.210
Non, Chiri and Pepper,

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:18.150
I wonder if they slept properly last night.

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:20.130
Are they nervous?

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:28.230
I've gotta help Onee-sama and treat all teams fairly! Order must be maintained!

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:31.100
But still...!

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:32.610
I know how you feel, Janice.

00:04:32.610 --> 00:04:34.330
I feel the same way.

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:37.570
By the way, do you know what day it is?

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:38.490
Huh?

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:46.950
Our singing and dancing is perfect, what should we work on next?

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:48.670
They are, but...

00:04:48.670 --> 00:04:50.050
I'm so nervous!

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:52.190
I don't want to say it, but

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:54.600
we're all nervous, aren't we?

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:56.960
Go away nerves!

00:04:59.890 --> 00:05:01.700
Ah, it's a shoebill delivery!

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:04.590
What? That bird is a postman?

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:08.160
A delivery for Pepper?

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:10.010
Good work, here's a lick!

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:13.830
It's from the Sappanah!

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:16.540
Is it thigh meat? Or maybe ribs!

00:05:18.010 --> 00:05:19.760
Ah, it's Mum!

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:26.370
Mum came all this way to watch us perform!

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:27.680
I'm so happy!

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:36.600
Non and Chiri aren't food, they're my beloved friends!

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:40.020
We're all gonna rule the world together, right?

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:46.530
Yeah, we'll rule PriPara!

00:05:49.350 --> 00:05:53.040
I actually wanted to meet our other mother too.

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:56.140
I wonder what Janice is up to right now...

00:05:58.730 --> 00:05:59.870
What's up?

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:01.530
Need something?

00:06:02.510 --> 00:06:05.160
Who goes there? State your name!

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:11.760
What's this?

00:06:12.230 --> 00:06:13.590
It's rock, paper, scissors!

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:16.010
Did you...

00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:18.780
Hold it right there!

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:26.150
Let's review the data of all previous Solami Smile Performances-pri.

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:28.400
As today's performance is the result of all of them!

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:30.050
Good work Mirei-kuma.

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:34.460
Now we can individually analyze where we're good and where we need improvement-kuma.

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:36.580
We're perfect here-pri.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:40.290
We've come so far, haven't we?

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:45.190
Yeah, it seems like we've rapidly climbed a tall mountain.

00:06:47.140 --> 00:06:48.470
I'm not good with heights-kuma!

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:49.820
I can't move!

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:51.190
I'm solid!

00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:53.600
Stop getting scared-pri!

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:56.250
Come in!

00:06:58.500 --> 00:06:59.690
Hello.

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:00.660
Who are you?

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:02.990
Are you a fan who's come to support us-pri?

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:09.290
Chocolate?

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:12.120
It's really tough being so popular-kuma!

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:14.390
Let's see here, let me have a taste...

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:17.410
Don't eat them-pri!

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:19.590
It's peach flavored-kuma!

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:20.480
Peach?

00:07:23.260 --> 00:07:24.000
Wait!!

00:07:24.240 --> 00:07:26.860
Wait!!

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:27.850
Janice!

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:30.630
Jululu!

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:32.680
It is you, right?

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:41.580
You came to see us, didn't you?

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:42.980
Thanks.

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:45.250
You came to see us...

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:48.610
That means so much...

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:53.380
We'll definitely become Divine Idols and save you!

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:59.000
Happy Valentine's Day!

00:08:05.070 --> 00:08:06.210
They disappeared...

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:08.250
The sky is pretty.

00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:11.730
Makes me remember when we formed our team-pri.

00:08:13.020 --> 00:08:18.890
We, Solami Smile, looked up and smiled at that very same sky.

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:22.310
My nervousness flew away in to the sky!

00:08:22.550 --> 00:08:24.110
Mine too,

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:28.020
because as long as we're together, there's no duel we can't win.

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:29.980
Thanks, Jululu.

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:31.670
Watch us, Janice.

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:32.950
We'll win for you.

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:53.580
Today is the long awaited third battle between these two groups.

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:57.040
Solami Smile and Nonsugar!

00:08:57.990 --> 00:09:00.220
Lala fight!

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:05.240
The stars in the sky are sparkling idol tears.

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:08.270
That's a myth from ancient PriPara.

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:15.490
I hope there are many passionate, beautiful performances at today's Divine Idol Gran Prix Final.

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:17.650
Solami Smile will win!

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:20.150
I'm so jealous of how young Nonsugar are!

00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:22.100
Nonsugar do your best!

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:27.890
She's saying "thanks for looking after my daughter"-nekon!

00:09:27.890 --> 00:09:29.540
It's nothing!

00:09:30.430 --> 00:09:32.760
Even the outside world is getting fired up!

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:36.000
Pepper, lick me!

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:44.650
By the way, do you know what floor this stage is on?

00:09:45.490 --> 00:09:46.470
The answer is...

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:48.310
STYLISH!

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:49.310
TOUGH!

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:50.560
Floor.

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:54.980
One, Two!

00:09:54.980 --> 00:09:55.970
One, Two..

00:09:58.140 --> 00:10:00.440
Match my pace!

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:02.240
No, you should match mine!

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:06.770
How about we climb while thinking about the Divine Dress we could win?

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:12.320
This is good, tension mega max!

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:14.000
I'm mega relaxing!

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:17.470
If we carry on like this, we could smash a diamond statue!

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:20.870
We're going for it, Divine Idol!

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:26.320
And the team that drew first is...

00:10:28.380 --> 00:10:31.130
Yeah, Nonsugar are first-ucha!

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:32.770
He who strikes first, wins-ucha!

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:40.240
Chiri, Pepper, let's do this!

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:51.710
Scan the MyTickets required for your coord.

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:54.660
You can also can your Friend Tickets too.

00:10:55.260 --> 00:10:56.820
Coord change start!

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:03.180
With a large, fluttering ribbon around your torso.

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:05.840
This team coord looks great from all angles!

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:07.390
Nonsugar coord!

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:11.970
I want to see them become Divine Idols.

00:11:12.430 --> 00:11:15.120
That's why I've worked so hard for this day-ucha!

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:18.980
These three will make my dreams come true-ucha!

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:21.730
Bow before me in unison!

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:26.610
Everyone here, feel my idol power flow through you!

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:31.500
Everyone is an idol, everyone gets licked!

00:11:31.940 --> 00:11:34.880
I'll show you the dance of the King of Sappanah!

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:39.140
Nonsugar are small and spicy!

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:41.940
Also really sweet!

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:47.190
Nobody can stop us now!

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:10.010
Making Drama, switch on!

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:42.450
Super Cyalume Change!

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:26.930
Nonsugar are the best!

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:28.830
They've powered up!

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:30.740
Rock, paper, scissors are invincible-nano!

00:14:30.900 --> 00:14:33.880
With that teamwork, they'll be a good battle for us!

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:35.500
What a performance!

00:14:35.650 --> 00:14:37.070
Usacha...

00:14:37.870 --> 00:14:41.310
Well done-usa! You're big bro is so moved-usa!

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:48.900
Amazing.

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:50.150
I expected no less of them-pri.

00:14:50.150 --> 00:14:51.540
Well done, Non!

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:52.770
But now...

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:54.000
It's time for us!

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:55.020
Onee-chan.

00:14:56.530 --> 00:14:58.300
Don't hold back.

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:01.210
I'll give it all I've got!

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:03.540
You do that.

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:04.980
Capisce!

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:07.570
Get you!

00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:09.380
Off we go!

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:16.670
Colorful check and lame fabric are a great match!

00:15:16.670 --> 00:15:18.810
The trio's favorite team coord!

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:20.610
Solami Smile coord!

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:27.030
When Solami Smile performs, everyone is happy, spring happy!

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:29.390
I don't even care about hibernation-kuma!

00:15:29.390 --> 00:15:31.990
Everyone get fired up, here we come-kuma!

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:34.440
Pop, step, get you!

00:15:34.440 --> 00:15:37.250
One plus one plus one equals infinity.

00:15:38.260 --> 00:15:40.930
My little caged birds...

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:43.520
I can't let you be good today.

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:46.290
So cool!

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:49.340
Look up and laugh!

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:51.960
I hope we make you all smile like you never have before!

00:15:52.670 --> 00:15:54.030
Solami Smile!

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:11.110
Making Drama, switch on!

00:17:49.020 --> 00:17:52.260
Super Cyalume Change!

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:26.910
I'll follow you anywhere Sophie-sama!

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:32.370
I knew they were a force to be reckoned with.

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:33.840
Thanks!

00:18:34.740 --> 00:18:39.960
What a performance from both teams, now for the results!

00:18:51.410 --> 00:18:54.660
We're invincible! We won't lose!

00:18:58.240 --> 00:18:59.790
Higher, higher!

00:19:00.330 --> 00:19:01.950
Look up to the sky!

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:14.920
It's been decided!

00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:18.420
Solami Smile proceed through to the semi-finals!

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:19.840
Congratulations!

00:19:27.320 --> 00:19:32.060
Solami Smile had the power of unification among the fans!

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:35.650
Nonsugar were amazing too, though.

00:19:42.890 --> 00:19:44.240
We did it-kuma!

00:19:44.240 --> 00:19:46.890
Let's have a long awaited toast-kuma!

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:47.760
Onee-chan...

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:50.070
I knew it would end like this.

00:19:50.070 --> 00:19:51.480
I lost.

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:53.520
Congratulations.

00:19:53.860 --> 00:19:54.720
Thanks.

00:19:55.100 --> 00:19:57.420
We were happy to have competed against you-pri.

00:19:57.420 --> 00:20:00.420
You've come so far in such a short time.

00:20:07.360 --> 00:20:08.150
Non!

00:20:22.090 --> 00:20:24.450
She says "Rulers don't cry...

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:27.450
stop or I'll throw you to the bottom of the valley"-nekon.

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:30.710
I'm not crying because I'm sad.

00:20:31.140 --> 00:20:32.870
I don't really know why...

00:20:33.890 --> 00:20:35.270
I do.

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:39.980
It's proof that you competed with everything you had.

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:42.100
Jewlie said it best-pri.

00:20:42.440 --> 00:20:44.860
Your tears become sparkling stars-pri.

00:20:46.420 --> 00:20:51.350
You're relationship with Usacha is amazing, it will last forever.

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:57.020
This isn't the end for us, right?

00:20:57.320 --> 00:21:00.310
Of course not, we're still young!

00:21:00.410 --> 00:21:02.570
We're totally fresh idols!

00:21:02.970 --> 00:21:05.570
I'll definitely rule PriPara someday!

00:21:05.680 --> 00:21:07.750
You'll all become Divine idols someday-ucha!

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:09.250
Lick!

00:21:30.840 --> 00:21:32.830
Happy Valentine's Day!

00:21:35.470 --> 00:21:38.490
Let's look at the diamond statue!

00:21:38.710 --> 00:21:41.030
Has the Divine Dress been released!?

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:43.780
We'll smash it to pieces-pri!

00:21:50.790 --> 00:21:51.540
Huh?

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:53.580
Just a fragment-kuma?

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:57.290
No way...

00:21:57.400 --> 00:22:00.690
The road to Divine Idol is a severe one!

00:22:00.940 --> 00:22:04.150
Looks like we'll have to wait until the next battle!

00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:06.730
And according to the card, that is...

00:22:08.550 --> 00:22:11.860
Tricolore vs Solami Smile!

00:22:16.130 --> 00:22:18.720
I love Tricolore!
